<p>A gathering has `$n` people. Each person shakes hands with every other person at the gathering exactly once.</p>
<p><b>Part a.</b> How many handshakes take place in total? $answerbox[0]</p>
<p><b>Part b.</b> At a different gathering, every person again shook hands with every other person exactly once, and this time there were `$H2` handshakes in total. How many people were at that gathering? $answerbox[1]</p>
<p><b>Part c.</b> The handshake count is given by `n(n-1)/2`, where `n` is the number of people. Which of the following are also counted by that same expression? Select all that apply. $answerbox[2]</p>

