// === QUESTION TEXT ===
<p>Camila and Rosa each kept a table of how many minutes late the morning delivery arrived on the shifts they worked. Camila covered $Nc shifts and Rosa covered $Nr shifts.</p>

<table border="1" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr><th>Minutes late</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>5</th><th>6</th><th>Total</th></tr>
