$solutionguide = '<p>Step 1 &mdash; A handshake is decided by the pair of people involved, and the pair A and B is the same pair as B and A. So the order of the two people does not matter, and we count combinations of 2 people chosen from ' . $n . '.</p>';
$solutionguide .= '<p>Step 2 &mdash; `C(' . $n . ', 2) = (' . $n . ' * ' . $nm1 . ')/2 = ' . $prod . '/2 = ' . $total . '`. Multiplying ' . $n . ' by ' . $nm1 . ' counts each handshake twice, once from each person, so we divide by 2.</p>';
